<p>kiski zabaa'n se pyaas ne paayi hai aabroo<br />
kis tashna lab ke hisse me aayi hai aabroo<br />
imaan kis ki qaak pa laayi hai aabroo<br />
aansu ki kis ke gham me badhaayi hai aabroo</p>

<p>kis pyase ke qalaq me hame shor-o- shain hai<br />
poocha jo naam pyaas pukaari hussain hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>nargha huwa hussain pa jo fouj-e shaam ka<br />
teero'n se jism chan gaya shaah-e anaam ka<br />
chillaya naam leke laee'n qaas-o aam ka<br />
aye marhaba ye hamla kiya tu ne kaam ka</p>

<p>haa'n mere rustumo'n na amaa'n do hussain ko<br />
noko'n pa barchiyo'n ki uthaalo hussain ko<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>taaqat huwi jo taaq shah-e dee'n panaah ki<br />
hasrat se sooe ganj-e shahidaa'n nigaah ki<br />
raakib ko zuljanaah ne dekha aur aah ki<br />
rokar hussain bole jo marzi ilaah ki</p>

<p>dard-o alam ki kis se talab daad kijiye<br />
bola wo bezabaan kuch irshaad kijiye<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>shafqat se haath ghode ki gardan me daal kar<br />
bole hame kuch aankho'n se aata nahi nazar<br />
ghode tu chal ke ganje shahidaa'n me ghour kar<br />
aaram karte hai ali akbar mere kidhar</p>

<p>aye aspe baawafaa mere dilko qaraar de<br />
aashiq ko chal ke unke baraabar utaar de<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>ghodaa qadam qadam sooe maqtal huwa rawaa'n<br />
yaani na sheh ke jism ko ho sadma-e takaa'n<br />
ek noujawaa'n ki laash pa tehra wo naagahaa'n<br />
boo soongh kar hussain pukaare yahi hai haa'n</p>

<p>baitha jo zuljanaah ke aap utre zeen se<br />
do haath kaanpte huwe nikle zameen se<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>haatho'n ke saath aayi ye aawaaz naagahaa'n<br />
hai hai ye gehre zaqm ye garmi ye al amaa'n<br />
aakar sambhaalte nahi abbas hai kahaa'n<br />
aao hamaari god me aao nisaar maa'n</p>

<p>mar kar bhi ham juda nahi pyaare ke saath hai<br />
waari ye tere paalne waale ke haath hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>un haatho'n ka mila jo sahara hussain ko<br />
ghode ne be takaan utaara hussain ko<br />
naiza sinaa'n ne doud ke maara hussain ko<br />
phir to raha na zabt ka yara hussain ko</p>

<p>jalti zameen pa ghash kayi saa-at pade rahe<br />
jallad gird tegho'n ko khainche khade rahe<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>lo momino larazta hai ab dasht-e karbala<br />
lo ghash huwa butool ki aaghosh ka palaa<br />
lo shimr zibha karne ko mazloom ke chala<br />
lo ab churi hai aur nabi zaade ka galaa</p>

<p>bete mu-e na nikli magar ab nikal padi<br />
mu dhanpo aye hussainiyo zainab nikal padi<br />
____________________________<br />
</p>